# SecureDocs Vault

Tagline: Safe document sharing for big deals.

Share sensitive files with investors and know exactly who opens them.

When you're raising money or closing a big deal, you can't just email sensitive PDFs. SecureDocs Vault lets you share your files securely and tracks exactly who opens them, which pages they read, and for how long. You can even lock them down after they've been downloaded.

Key features:
- Dynamic Watermarking: User email on every page. Prevent leaks.
- Access Logs: See who viewed what. Gauge interest.
- Expiry Dates: Files self-destruct. Control timeframe.
- Q&A Module: Manage questions. Streamline due diligence.

Benefits:
- Deal Security
- Investor Insights
- Professional Image
- Compliance

FAQs:

Q: Is there a limit?
A: No, we provide unlimited storage for all active deals. You only pay for the deal slot.

Q: Can I stop someone downloading?
A: Yes, you can enable "View Only" mode which blocks the print and download functions.

Q: Is the watermark unique?
A: Yes, every page has the viewer's specific email address watermarked across it.

Q: Is it safer than Dropbox?
A: Significantly. Dropbox is for storage; SecureDocs is built for high-stakes compliance and deal-making.

Q: Can I see if they read page 12?
A: Yes, our "Deep Insight" report shows you time spent on every single page of every PDF.

Q: Can I kick someone out?
A: Yes, you can revoke access instantly, even if the user is currently looking at a file.

Q: Does it support E-Sign?
A: Yes, we have an integrated signing module for NDAs and contracts.

Q: Is it GDPR compliant?
A: Our platform supports EU-only or US-only data center residency options, helping you align with GDPR requirements.

Q: What does the "Dynamic Watermarking" capability include?
A: User email on every page. The benefit: prevent leaks.

Q: What does the "Access Logs" capability include?
A: See who viewed what. The benefit: gauge interest.